Database integration tests verify that your API correctly persists, retrieves, and manipulates data in the database.

**Database Testing Strategies**:

| Strategy | Description | Pros | Cons |
|----------|-------------|------|------|
| **Test Database** | Dedicated test DB | Isolated, realistic | Slower, setup time |
| **In-Memory DB** | SQLite, H2 | Fast, no setup | Not production-like |
| **Test Containers** | Docker DB per test | Production-like, isolated | Slower, resource heavy |
| **Transactions** | Rollback after test | Fast, isolated | DB-specific |
| **Fixtures** | Pre-loaded test data | Fast, repeatable | Brittle, static |

