**Key Insight**: Documentation is code. Test it like code. Automate verification of docs against the actual API to catch mismatches before developers do.

Intuitiveness measures how easily a developer can guess how to use your API without reading documentation. It's about aligning with developer expectations.

**The Intuitiveness Test**:

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    THE INTUITIVENESS TEST                         │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                                   │
│  Give a developer:                                                │
│  • API base URL                                                   │
│  • Authentication token                                           │
│  • One task: "Get the orders for user 123"                        │
│                                                                   │
│  Time them. Count how many attempts.                             │
│                                                                   │
│  INTUITIVE: First guess works (<30 seconds)                      │
│  OK: Second guess works (<2 minutes)                             │
│  BAD: Need to read docs (>5 minutes)                             │
│  TERRIBLE: Give up or get it wrong                               │
│                                                                   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Common Developer Assumptions to Test**:

| Assumption | Test | Good Result | Bad Result |
|------------|------|-------------|------------|
| **Plural for collections** | GET /user (singular) | 404 with helpful message | 200 returning single user |
| **ID in URL** | GET /orders?id=123 | 404 with guidance | 200 with some order |
| **POST for create** | PUT /users to create | 405 with Allow header | 200 but doesn't create |
| **DELETE for delete** | POST /users/123/delete | 404 with guidance | 200 but doesn't delete |
| **Pagination with page/limit** | GET /users?page=2 | Works or clear error | Confusing error |

