|----------|-----|-----|
| **Realistic Spike Size** | Know your worst case | Analyze traffic patterns |
| **Test Hot Content** | Spikes target specific items | Simulate cache stampede |
| **Monitor Auto-scaling** | Does it scale fast enough? | Track scale-up events |
