In a microservices architecture, each service is both a consumer and provider. Contract testing becomes a web of relationships that must be managed.

**Microservice Contract Graph:**

```
        ┌─────────────┐
        │   Frontend  │
        └─────────────┘
               │
        ┌──────▼──────┐
        │  User API   │
        └──────┬──────┘
